{"title":"USA TST Problems and Solutions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Problems and solutions from the U.S.A. <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TST\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"TST\">TSTs</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_USA_TST\" title=\"2000 USA TST\">2000 USA TST</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_USA_TST\" title=\"2001 USA TST\">2001 USA TST</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_USA_TST\" title=\"2002 USA TST\">2002 USA TST</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_USA_TST\" title=\"2003 USA TST\">2003 USA TST</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_USA_TST\" title=\"2004 USA TST\">2004 USA TST</a></li></ul>\n<p>Break\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_USA_TST\" title=\"2025 USA TST\">2025 USA TST</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USA_TST_Problems_and_Solutions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MOP\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MOP\">MOP</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Mathematics_Competitions\" title=\"American Mathematics Competitions\">American Mathematics Competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC Problems and Solutions\">AMC Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017131732\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreproce